---
id: org.dxos.plugin.risky
name: Risky
version: 0.1.0
---

A fixture spec with one unbound reference and one unsafe teardown, for `deus qa lint`.

## QA

```mdl
test QA-1: Uses names it never binds
  given:
    - space: an empty space
  steps:
    - do: open $given.space
    - do: rename $given.document to $title
      capture: title
    - do: delete $orphan
```

```mdl
test QA-2: Removes whatever comes first
  steps:
    - do: create a document
  after:
    - do: remove the document
      invoke: removeObjects(db.query(Filter.type(Document)).objects[0])
```
